Z||000000||BENGAL4||01-09-2000||09:48 PM||||HELP.<P>I want to post some pictures of my car and I can't figure it out. I downloaded the PIP, but after that, I am lost. Zip, unzip? I am lost. Please help. I want to share my Fiero with the Forum.  ||||reg||5
Z||000001||Monkeyman||01-09-2000||09:53 PM||||Hello, Bengal4!  Did you get my email?  Just follow the directions on PIP.  I didn't have to unzip anything.  I made sure that mine were JPEG files, though.  Once you are typing your post, open PIP, click on "Browse", select your pic, click on "Post It", and once it's uploaded (it'll tell you), get back into your post and press "Ctrl-V".  That should be it.  If you're having problems, I can post some pics that I took if you want.  LMK||||reg||1
